@startuml dependencies_detailed_auth
title User Authentication - Auth Module Detailed Dependencies

' Auth Java Components
package "Auth Java Components" {
  [AuthenticationManager.java] as AUTH_MGR <<Service>>
  [PasswordValidator.java] as PWD_VAL <<Utility>>
}

' Auth SQL Components
package "Auth SQL Components" {
  [auth_procedures.sql] as AUTH_PROC <<Stored Procedures>>
  [user_schema.sql] as USER_SCHEMA <<DDL Script>>
}

' Auth Frontend Components
package "Auth Frontend Components" {
  [LoginForm.jsx] as LOGIN_FORM <<React Component>>
  [AuthProvider.jsx] as AUTH_PROVIDER <<Context Provider>>
}

' External dependencies from other modules
package "External Module Dependencies" <<Cloud>> {
  [SessionManager.java] as SESS_MGR <<Session Module>>
  [UserRepository.java] as USER_REPO <<User Module>>
  [TokenGenerator.java] as TOKEN_GEN <<Common>>
  [BaseService.java] as BASE_SVC <<Common>>
  [SessionMonitor.js] as SESS_MONITOR <<Session Module>>
}

' External systems
cloud "External Systems" {
  [LDAP Directory] as LDAP
  [Email Service] as EMAIL
}

database "Data Storage" {
  [User Database\nUSERS, AUTH_LOGS] as DB
  [Redis Cache] as CACHE
}

' Intra-module dependencies (within Auth)
AUTH_MGR --> PWD_VAL : validates password\ncheckComplexity()
LOGIN_FORM --> AUTH_PROVIDER : uses context\nlogin action
AUTH_PROC --> USER_SCHEMA : executes on\nUSERS table

' Cross-component dependencies within Auth
AUTH_MGR ..> AUTH_PROC : invokes via\nJDBC CallableStatement
LOGIN_FORM ..> AUTH_MGR : REST API call\nPOST /api/auth/login

' Inter-module dependencies (Auth to other modules)
AUTH_MGR --> USER_REPO : retrieves user\nfindByUsername()
AUTH_MGR --> SESS_MGR : creates session\ncreateSession(userId)
AUTH_MGR --> BASE_SVC : inherits from\nbase functionality
AUTH_PROVIDER --> SESS_MONITOR : monitors session\ncheckTimeout()
SESS_MGR --> TOKEN_GEN : generates token\ngenerateSessionToken()

' External integrations
AUTH_PROC -down-> DB : INSERT/UPDATE USERS\nDML operations
AUTH_MGR --> LDAP : LDAP bind\nuser authentication
AUTH_MGR --> EMAIL : password reset\nemail notifications
AUTH_MGR --> CACHE : failed attempts\nRedis INCR/GET

' Color coding (High relevance in green)
AUTH_MGR #LightGreen
PWD_VAL #LightGreen
LOGIN_FORM #LightGreen
AUTH_PROVIDER #LightGreen
AUTH_PROC #LightGreen
USER_SCHEMA #LightGreen

note right of AUTH_MGR
  **Core Auth Service**

  - Lines: 450
  - Score: 95/100
  - Features: Login, Logout,
    Password validation,
    Account lockout
end note

note bottom of PWD_VAL
  **Password Validation**

  Enforces password policy:
  - Minimum 8 characters
  - Complexity requirements
  - BCrypt hashing
end note

legend right
